nge: redesign-process-list-activity-bar. Accepts `onSpawnSibling?(session)` prop. Renders always-visible `+Session` button (mdiPlus, data-testid `session-card-spawn-sibling`) in fork/resume pill row. NOT gated on `status === "ended"` or `sessionFile` (unlike Fork/Resume). Disabled when `session.cwdMissing` (tooltip `session's directory no longer exists`). Click calls `onSpawnSibling(session)`. SessionList wires via `onSpawnSession(s.cwd, s.attachedProposal \|\| undefined)`; clean sibling spawn inherits cwd + attachedProposal. Accepts `onSpawnWorktree?(session)` prop. Renders `+Worktree` button (mdiSourceBranchPlus, orange, data-testid `session-card-spawn-worktree`) next to `+Session`; gated upstream by `gitWorktreeEnabled`; hidden when `session.gitWorktree` set (no worktree-from-worktree); also hidden ONLY when `session.isGitRepo === false` (confirmed non-git) — `true`/`undefined` keep it (no gitBranch gate; that is a data-arrival signal). See change: gate-session-worktree-button-on-git. Disabled when `cwdMissing`. Click calls `onSpawnWorktree(session)`. SessionList routes: `attachedProposal` set → `setWorktreeForChange({cwd, changeName})` (proposal-aware WorktreeSpawnDialog, branch `os/<change>`); else `setWorktreeDialogCwd(cwd)` (plain dialog). Reuses WorktreeSpawnDialog (create worktree + bootstrap + spawn). See change: session-card-plus-session-button. Threads `onReplaceProposal` callback to SessionOpenSpecActions. See change: replace-proposal-dialog-with-race-handling. `getCardPulseClass` returns `card-input-stripes` for ask_user (was `card-input-pulse`). New `getCardStripeFxClass` maps state marker class to `.card-stripes-fx` color class. Card `<li>` gains `relative isolate`; renders `.card-stripes-fx` overlay (behind content, z-index -1) + `.card-ring-fx` overlay when selected. See change: throttle-idle-ui-animations. Card-state helpers relocated to session-status-visuals.ts; SessionCard imports + re-exports `getCardPulseClass`/`getCardStripeFxClass` for test compat. See change: port-session-card-state-visuals-to-openspec-board. ActivityIndicator label split: ask_user→"Needs you" (--status-needs-you), idle/active→"Idle" (muted); "Waiting for input" retired. `StatusShapeBadge` overlays shape marker on session-status-icon (`data-status-shape`). Threads `hasWidgetBarPrompt` into dot/rail/shape. See change: improve-dashboard-attention-routing. `GroupGitInfo` gains `folderBranch?: string\|null`; branch precedence `folderBranch ?? session.gitBranch ?? fetchedBranch`; `folderBranch===null` renders Init-git non-git state; `branchCache`/REST stays first-paint seed. See change: refresh-folder-header-branch. Renders `<WorktreeCardSectionSlot folder={{cwd: session.cwd}}>` between OPENSPEC and GIT subcards, gated on `session.gitWorktree` set. Surfaces the worktree's own KB row (worktree collapses under `gitWorktree.mainPath` in the sidebar, so its cwd never gets a folder card). Scoped to the worktree cwd, not the parent repo. See change: kb-row-on-worktree-session-card. `WorktreePill` renders the BARE `worktree` label only — the `· <name>` suffix was removed: `gitWorktree.name` is `slugifyBranch(branch)` by construction, so it repeated the adjacent branch link, and as an unshrinkable inline-flex in GitInfo's flex row a long name wrapped to two lines inside the pill and overlapped the GIT subcard label. `worktree-pill-name` testid retired; tooltip unchanged (`created from <base>` / `git worktree`). See change: fix-worktree-pill-name-overflow.
